		(uuid "a15720a0-13fc-4805-bbe5-aad962096a50")
	)
	(text_box "The diagram is a simplified representation of the STM32F030C8Tx microcontroller and does not reproduce its physical pinout on a one-to-one basis. The available schematic symbol does not explicitly show the expected GND, 5 V or 3.3 V connections in the form required for this design.\n\nFor diagrammatic purposes, VDDA and VSSA were used to represent the supply and ground connections, respectively. However, this is a graphical simplification and should not be interpreted as an indication that VDDA is a 5 V input or a replacement for the MCU's actual VDD and VSS connections.\n\nIn the physical implementation, the supply and ground connections must follow the STM32F030C8Tx datasheet and the requirements of the specific board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
